    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n59685" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κρᾰταιό-ω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>strengthen</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰς χεῖράς τινος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					LXX
					<u>1 Ki.</u>
					23.16
				</span></i>
			, al.:—
				Pass.
			, ib.<i><span class="en">
				30.6
			</span></i>, al., <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ev.Luc.</u>
				1.80
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>1 Ep.Cor.</u>
				16.13
			</span></i>, etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. ὑπέρ τινα</span>
			<i>to be too strong for</i> him, <i>prevail against</i> him,
				<i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>2 Ki.</u>
				10.11
			</span></i>, al. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			
				Pass.
			, <i>to be determined</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. τοῦ
				πορεύεσθαι</span> ib. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ru.</u>
				1.18
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> intr. in 
				Act.
			, <i>prevail</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπί
			τινας</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				<u>2 Ki.</u>
				11.23
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπέρ τινας</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				<u>3 Ki.</u>
				21(20).23
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			
				Med.
			, <i>control</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πάθη λόγῳ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ph.
					1.420
				</span></i>
			.</div>
